   eg='The handout’s four entries: Revenue Receipts (taxes, fines, dividends), Revenue Expenditure (salaries, subsidies, interest), Capital Receipts (G-Secs, disinvestment, recovery of loans), Capital Expenditure (highways, loans to States, repayment of principal). Defence: ammunition and rations are Revenue; fighter jets are Capital.',
