   eg='The handout’s example: a ₹1,000 intra-State sale at 18% gives CGST ₹90 to the Centre and SGST ₹90 to the State; an inter-State sale gives IGST ₹180. Ease of Doing Business rank: 130 (2017), 77 (2019), 63 (2020).',
